    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mulungu kūng'wisagīja Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū ntemi aho wigasha ū ng'wikūlū lyakwe ūlembeela, nū SEEBA ūng'wifuuja ū kū banishi bakwe bose abo baalī bampīndīlīgije hose hose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūng'wīla ng'hangi Nasani, “Ū nene ī haha nalī mu numba yawiza ya mitī ya ng'wininga, alīyo ī lisandīko lya ng'wa Mulungu līlī ng'wiheema!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Nasani ūnshokeja ū ntemi alīhaya, “Gwītage ūyo ūlī nago ū mu ng'holò yako, nguno ū SEEBA alī hamò nang'ho.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būjikū wenūbo ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūng'wizīīla ū Nasani; gūng'wīla, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jaga ūkang'wīle ū ntūmami wane ū Daūdi, Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, “Ū bebe hū ūkūnizengela numba ya kwikala mo ū nene? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūfuma ī likanza īlo nakabīnja a Baisilaeli mu Misili kūshisha lelo īyī, nataalī kwikala mu numba. Naakwījaga ī myaka nakūjaga ūko nū kūko, alīyo ū wikalo wane ng'wiheema dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Līlīho īpandī lyose lyose ūko naja hamò nabo a banhū bane a Baisilaeli, hūna nūlūngalūnga na nsugi nūūlū ūmò ū mu banhū abo naabalagīlaga kūbadīīma, nūng'wīla gīkī, ‘Nibūlī ūtaalī kūnizengela numba ya mitī ya ng'wininga?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ū ntūmami wane ū Daūdi ng'wīlage gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA wa būdūla bose alīhaya gīkī, Ū bebe nakwīnja kū madīīmīlo, nūkūlecha nīmo gwa kūdīīma ng'holo nguno naalī natogilwe ūbize nsugi wa banhū bane Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nalī hamò nang'ho būlī kwene ūko ūkūjaga, na a banishi bako nakūjaga nūbayagaja nene ū kū būtongi wako. Na lūūlū ī haha nakūlīkūja no ī lina lyako, lībize itaale gīt'ūmo galī mina ga bataale ba mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma a banhū bane a Baisilaeli nakūbabeegeja ipandī lyabo benekīlī, nabahambe ho gete, bapandīke kaya yabo ya wikomangīle; booye ū kwikala bakūkoyakoyiagwa. A banhū babūbi batūbakoya hangī gīt'ūmo bīītīlaga ī kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno h'ūmo bakūbīītīlaga nī haha a banhū bane a Baisilaeli, kūfuma aho nandīja kūbatūūlīla balamuji. Nīyo nakūkwifuuja gete booye ū kūkūkoya a banishi bako pye a bose.’ Hama a higūlya ya yenīyo ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA ng'wenekīlī akūkūbeegeja numba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shikū jako ūlū jūshila, lyūshika ikanza lya kwifuula na bakūlūgenji bako, nakūngūngūhya ūmò wa mu būbyīle wako, wa kūfuma mu nkīmbīlī gwako gete, abize ng'wingīji wako; ū būtemi wakwe nakūwinha nguzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wenūyo h'ūyo akūzenga numba kūlwa nguno ya lina lyane; ī lisumbī lya būtemi bokwe nakūlyīta līshinge ho kūshisha welelo bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nakūbiza Ise, ū wei akūbiza ng'wana wane. Ūlū ūhūba nakūntūla na nang'ha gwa banhū; nakūtūmamīla banhū ū kū ntwenya manasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū būtogwa wane natīko ū kūng'wīngīja gīt'ūmo nakang'wīngīja Saulo, ūyo nakansunda ha mhūjo akwīngīle bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī numba yako nū būtemi wako shikūshinga ho welelo bose ū kū būtongi wane; ī lisumbī lyako lya būtemi līkwinhwa nguzu shikū jose ja welelo na welelo.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Nasani ūng'winha ū Daūdi ī mihayo ya koolekegeje kenaka pyī ūmo kagelelile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlomba kwa ng'wa Daūdi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi Daūdi wingīla mu gatī wigasha kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA ūhaya, “SEEBA wa būdūla bose, ū nene nalī nani, nī kaya yane īlī kīnhū kī, nose ūnishishe mu mbika gītī īyī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "SEEBA wa būdūla bose, ū mhayo gwenūyū ū mu miso gako gūlībiza gītī gūlī ndo no, nguno a higūlya ya henaho ongejaga na kūyomba mihayo ya numba ya ntūmami wako kūlwa shikū ja kū būtongi. Ee SEEBA wa būdūla bose, ī yenīyī h'īyo ūkabīītīlaga banhū na kale? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī lūūlū ū Daūdi ongenje mhayo kī gūngī ū gwa kūkūwīla? Nguno ū bebe SEEBA wa Būdūla bose ūndeebile gete ū ntūmami wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ū ntaale gwenūyū wagwītaga kūlwa nguno ya kwisagīja kwako na kasolele ka ng'holò yako, hūna ūmanīkīja ū ntūmami wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee SEEBA wa būdūla bose, ū būtaale wako būkīlanīgije no; atīho ūngī wa kūlenganījiwa nang'ho, na atīho Mulungu ūngī ūlū ūtī bebe wike, gīt'ūmo twigwīla na matū gise benekīlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Līlīho ihanga kī līngī ū mu sī īlo līdūgije kūlenganījiwa na Baisilaeli banhū bako, abo Mulungu akaja kūbakomoola gīkī babize bakwe, ibeegeje lina lyakwe wei ng'wenekīlī; hūna ūbeeja mihayo mitaale ya kogohya na kūkaamaaja, ūpeeja mahanga na bamulungu baago gīkī babīngīle a banhū bako abo ūkabakomoola kūfuma Misili? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bebe ng'wenekīlī ūbazenga a banhū bako a Baisilaeli, ūbīīta kūbiza bako ba wikomangīle welelo bose. Na ng'hana SEEBA, ūbiza ūlī Mulungu wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū SEEBA Mulungu, ū mhayo ūyo wagūhayaga kūlwa nguno yane nene ntūmami wako nī numba yane, gūshikīlījage gūje gīko shikū jose welelo na welelo; ītaga gīt'ūmo kūlī kwisagīja kwako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko ī lina lyako līkūgūngūhiwa welelo bose; a banhū bakūhaya gīkī, ‘Ū SEEBA wa būdūla bose hū ng'wene ū Mulungu wa Baisilaeli.’ Hūn'ī kaya ya ntūmami wako ū Daūdi īkūlama ū kū būtongi wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū bebe SEEBA wa būdūla bose, Mulungu wa Baisilaeli, hū bebe wankundūlīlaga ū ntūmami wako ū mhayo gwenūyū ūng'wīla gīkī, ‘Nakūkūzengela numba.’ H'ī nguno yene ū ntūmami wako wapandīkaga būshisha ng'holò wa kūkwenhela būlombi gītī wenūbū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.7.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 7:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee SEEBA wa Būdūla bose, ū bebe hū ūlī Mulungu! Ī mihayo yako īlī ya kūsanyiwa; bebe hū wang'wisagījaga ū ntūmami wako ī mihayo ī yawiza īyī. ",
